  "description": "GuyThatDies 0.5 / 0.5.5 FR campaign adaptation, checked 2026-10-12. Opening 1-5; ED 6-13; Ember 14-18; first-ascendancy swap ~19; campaign Djinn onward. Trial/drop/Spirit gates apply. Passives disabled; five original source exports contain trees. Thunderstorm gem level 5; do not upgrade Contagion/Pounce. https://mobalytics.gg/poe-2/profile/guythatdies/builds/0-4-varashta-levelling",
