          "additional_text": "Unleash\nSlot [1]. T1 priority 1.\nFirst T1. Move between opening clear and weapon-spell bossing; at level 6 move to Contagion for clear. These are destinations for one transferable support, not four required cuts."
        }
      ]
    },
