  "inventory_slots": [
    {
      "inventory_id": "Weapon1",
      "level_interval": [1, 18],
      "additional_text": "Caster opening. Useful spell levels, damage gained as extra, damage, cast speed. Firebolt/Chaos Bolt are weapon-granted; use Unleash for bosses and move it to Spark/Contagion for clear. ED + Contagion from 6; Ember Fusillade from 14. Move Zenith I between ED and Ember rather than requiring two cuts. Save +minion sceptre/helmet for the first ascendancy."
    },
    {
      "inventory_id": "Weapon1",
      "level_interval": [19, 100],
      "additional_text": "FIRST ASCENDANCY REQUIRED, not merely level 19. Sceptre + shield; prioritize +minion levels and nearby-allies damage. MANUAL SETUP: Kelari/Deception [1] Bidding I/II; [2] Magnified Area I/II for clear OR Concentrated Area for bosses; [3] Muster at level 36 once available. Djinn sockets unlock by level, not Jewellers. Summon different affordable reviving types; cheap wasp from Sandswept Marsh for Bind Spectre. No Fire Djinn / Pain Offering / Lineage required.\nThunderstorm: KEEP GEM LEVEL 5. [1] Living Lightning; later [2] Prolonged Duration II; [3] Magnified Area II if a third ordinary socket is available.\nTree snapshots: https://mobalytics.gg/poe-2/profile/guythatdies/builds/0-4-varashta-levelling"
    },
    {
      "inventory_id": "Weapon2",
      "level_interval": [6, 100],
      "additional_text": "Wolf talisman for Pounce. Do not upgrade Pounce. From the swap: [1] Mark for Death; [2] Prolonged Duration I/II. Meta gems may not display in the experimental planner; socket manually. Return to the main weapon set for the Djinn/minion setup."
    },
    {
      "inventory_id": "Helm1",
      "level_interval": [19, 100],
      "additional_text": "+minion skill levels, then resistances / life / ES."
    },
